  "citation": "\u00d6zgen-Xian I; Molins S; Xu Z; Dwivedi D; Kesserwani G; Caviedes-Voullieme D; Moulton D J; Steefel C I (2020): Overland flow numerical model prediction, Lower Triangle Region in East River Watershed, Colorado, 3 days. IDEAS Applications: Reactive-Transport and Integrated Hydrology Model Development (IDEAS = Interoperable Design of Extreme Scale Application Software). Dataset. doi:10.15485/1734791",
  "dataset": {
